@startuml Cost Savings Participant Diagram
title Figure X: Cost Savings Data Aggregation Participant Diagram

' Professional Sequence Diagram Styling
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 40
skinparam BoxPadding 10

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #0078d4
    LifeLineBorderColor #0078d4
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #f0f7ff
    
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #f0f7ff
    ParticipantBorderColor #0078d4
    ParticipantFontSize 14
    ParticipantFontColor #0078d4
    
    ActorBackgroundColor #f0f7ff
    ActorBorderColor #0078d4
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #fff9e6
    BorderColor #d4a017
    FontSize 11
}

actor "Plant Operator" as User
participant "CostSavingsDashboard.jsx" as UI <<Boundary>>
participant "SupabaseDashboardService" as Service <<Control>>
database "Supabase DB" as DB <<Database>>

autonumber

User -> UI : Open Cost Savings Dashboard
activate UI

UI -> Service : getOptimizationStats(30 days)
activate Service
Service -> DB : SELECT stats FROM history
activate DB
DB --> Service : aggregated stats
deactivate DB
Service --> UI : { totalCost, totalCo2, ... }
deactivate Service

UI -> Service : getOptimizationHistory(100 entries)
activate Service
Service -> DB : SELECT * FROM history ORDER BY date
activate DB
DB --> Service : raw history entries
deactivate DB
Service --> UI : array of history entries
deactivate Service

UI -> UI : calculateWeeklyProjection(history)
UI -> UI : groupByMonth(history)
note right : Aggregates USD savings\ninto monthly buckets for chart.

UI -> UI : Render BarChart (Trends)
UI -> UI : Render PieChart (Breakdown)
UI --> User : Display Financial Impact & ROI
deactivate UI

note right of UI
  **Data Synthesis:**
  The UI synthesizes raw history
  into actionable financial metrics
  and environmental impact stats.
end note

@enduml
